  "summary": "<p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW132840559 BCX0\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW132840559 BCX0\">The Malta Premier is Malta’s top-tier domestic football competition and the pinnacle of the national football pyramid. It brings together the country’s leading clubs to compete for the title of Maltese champions and for qualification to prestigious European competitions under the governance of UEFA. The league<span> </span></span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW132840559 BCX0\">represents</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW132840559 BCX0\"><span> </span>the highest standard of football on the island and serves as the main stage for<span> </span></span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW132840559 BCX0\">showcasing</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW132840559 BCX0\"><span> </span>Malta’s elite footballing talent.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW132840559 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> </span></p>",
